# KaBuM!

> KaBuM! is a Brazilian e-commerce company specializing in technology, focusing on hardware, gaming products, electronics, smart home devices, and smartphones. The website offers a wide variety of products and content related to the tech world.

- [KaBuM! Homepage](https://www.kabum.com.br): Homepage of the e-commerce site, highlighting offers, main categories, and promotional campaigns.

